  <h2 id="h-claims" style="margin-top:8px">What this story can support, and what it can't yet</h2>
  <p>I graded these myself. Each claim is either visible on this page, backed by a linked public source, or my professional judgement, which this page doesn't test.</p>
  <details class="claimsbox"><summary>Claims register · 11 claims, and how well each is supported</summary>
  <dl class="legend">
    <div><dt><span class="cl">observed</span></dt><dd>Visible on this page. You can check it here.</dd></div>
